PARSFILE
#FullDataName Vehicle: Assembly`Utility Truck`Utility Vehicles
#VehCode Ind_SA
#CheckBox0 0    
#CheckBox1 0    

#RingCtrl0 0
OPT_PT 0
#RingCtrl1 1
#RingCtrl2 3
#RingCtrl3 0

* Front components
iaxle 1
symbol_push  <<axle>> 1
PARSFILE Suspensions\Kin_Indy\KinInd_e548bf39-8cf9-4ac9-87da-be31de48761a.par
#BlueLink19 Suspension: Independent System Kinematics`Utility Truck - Front` ` , Kinematics`KinInd_e548bf39-8cf9-4ac9-87da-be31de48761a

