OPT_ALL_FOUR_TIRES_ALIKE 1

* LF tire
iside 1
WRITE_ADD_REFERENCE_FRAME_WHEEL
symbol_push  <<tire>> L<<axle>>
PARSFILE Tires\Tire\Tire_47113735-159f-4abe-9da9-054e0c04e549.par
#BlueLink999 Tire`Pacejka 5.2 (Symmetric)` ` , Tire`Tire_47113735-159f-4abe-9da9-054e0c04e549


