#BlueLink10 Tire`Pacejka 5.2 (Symmetric)` ` , Tire`Tire_47113735-159f-4abe-9da9-054e0c04e549

* Rear components
iaxle 2
symbol_add  <<axle>> 1
WRITE_ADD_REFERENCE_FRAME_AXLE
